Package: szukaj-cpu
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: szukaj_cpu <noreply@github.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, ca-certificates
Recommends: ffmpeg, intel-media-va-driver | i965-va-driver, vainfo
Suggests: ntfy
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/8brzrs26ws-cloud/szukaj_cpu
Description: person detection on RTSP CCTV streams (YOLO on CPU, VAAPI decoding)
 szukaj_cpu analyses keyframes from RTSP camera streams with a YOLO model
 running on the CPU through OpenVINO, decodes video on the Intel iGPU
 (VAAPI), and records events: thumbnails, full-resolution frames, clips cut
 from the main stream, a browsable HTML gallery, ntfy push notifications and
 events on the Shinobi CCTV timeline.
 .
 Installs to /opt/szukaj_cpu. Per-user configuration lives in
 ~/.szukaj_cpu/szukaj_cpu.toml; the service is szukaj_cpu@<user>.service.
